N.4041="comment"*50x6*67x25<M>
C="{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\deff0\\deflang1033{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\fnil\\fcharset0 Arial;}}
\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\fs20 Inputs:  S, R are both pulse inputs\\par
Output: Q switches to ON when an S pulse is received and switches to OFF when a R pulse is received. \\par
\\par
Truth Table:\\par
S    R     Q\\par
----------------------\\tab\\par
0     0     Q(k-1)\\par
0     1     0\\par
1     0     1\\par
1     1     1 \\par
}
"
